# The build context is the repository root. Only the watcher and the shared
# Go module it builds against go into the build; read by BuildKit instead of
# a .dockerignore next to the context.
*
!libs/go
!watcher-service

# Not part of the image
**/*_test.go
**/.git
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.swp
**/*.exe
**/*.env
**/.env*
**/README.md
